---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  titleOverride="Residential Construction Services in Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="VP Infra offers trusted residential construction services in Lucknow. Custom homes, apartments & housing projects built with ISO-certified quality. Call 8840069902."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82)), url('/images/residential_construction_lucknow.webp');">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up">Residential Construction Services in Lucknow</h1>
      <p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Building homes that your family will live in, love, and pass on for generations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Details -->
  <section class="service-details">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
        <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Your Home, Built the Right Way</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">At V.P. Infra Properties (OPC) Pvt. Ltd., we have spent years delivering residential construction services in Lucknow that families trust with their most important investment. A home is not just a structure. It is where your children grow up, where you celebrate milestones, and where you finally sit down after a long day. We take that seriously.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">Our ISO 9001:2015 certified process covers everything from soil testing and structural design to final plaster, flooring, and electrical finishing. Every project gets a dedicated site engineer, weekly progress reports, and a construction timeline you can actually hold us to. No vague promises, no verbal commitments.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">What We Build</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Independent Houses and Bungalows:</strong> Ground-up construction on your plot, designed to your floor plan, budget, and preferences.</li>
            <li><strong>Apartments and Multi-Storey Residences:</strong> Structurally sound, multi-unit residential buildings with earthquake-resistant RCC frames.</li>
            <li><strong>Housing Society Projects:</strong> Gated community layouts with common infrastructure, boundary walls, and shared utility planning.</li>
            <li><strong>Plot Development and Foundation Work:</strong> Site levelling, bore drilling, plinth construction, and drainage before the main build begins.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Our Construction Process</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">We follow a six-stage process on every residential project. It starts with a site visit and feasibility check, moves into structural design and municipal approval, then foundation casting, superstructure, finishing, and final quality inspection. Each stage is signed off before the next begins.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">We use M25-grade concrete for load-bearing columns, TMT bars with Fe 500 grade steel, and AAC blocks or red bricks depending on the structural requirement. Our in-house procurement team sources materials directly from manufacturers, which keeps quality consistent and eliminates the risk of substandard substitutions on site.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Why Lucknow Families Choose VP Infra</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Local Expertise:</strong> We understand Lucknow's soil conditions, municipal approval process, and construction requirements better than out-of-town contractors.</li>
            <li><strong>Transparent Agreements:</strong> You receive a detailed Bill of Quantities before work starts. No surprise additions midway through the project.</li>
            <li><strong>MSME Registered:</strong> Our UDYAM registration (UP-50-0085926) means we are a verified, accountable business entity.</li>
            <li><strong>On-Time Completion:</strong> We have delivered projects across Ashiyana, Sushant Golf City, Indira Nagar, and Gomti Nagar within agreed timelines.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="internal-links-section mt-8">
            <p>Explore our other construction services:</p>
            <ul class="related-links">
              <li><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/turnkey-building-contractors-in-lucknow/">Turnkey building contractors in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Custom home builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/duplex-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Duplex construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/commercial-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Commercial construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/">Read our construction guides</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <img src="/images/residential_construction_lucknow.webp" alt="Residential Construction Services in Lucknow — VP Infra" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Everything You Need to Know — Improved UI -->
  <section class="know-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="know-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="know-subtitle">Key facts about residential construction in Lucknow — timelines, permits, materials, and more.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="know-stats">
        <div class="know-stat">
          <span class="know-stat-value">6–9</span>
          <span class="know-stat-desc">Months, ground floor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="know-stat">
          <span class="know-stat-value">M25</span>
          <span class="know-stat-desc">Grade concrete used</span>
        </div>
        <div class="know-stat">
          <span class="know-stat-value">ISO</span>
          <span class="know-stat-desc">9001:2015 Certified</span>
        </div>
        <div class="know-stat">
          <span class="know-stat-value">48 hr</span>
          <span class="know-stat-desc">Site visit turnaround</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="know-grid">
        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🗓️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Timelines</h3>
            <p>A standard ground floor home in Lucknow takes 6 to 9 months from foundation casting to final handover. A double-storey structure of similar footprint takes 10 to 14 months. Timelines depend on plot size, design complexity, monsoon breaks, and material availability. At VP Infra, we provide a week-by-week construction schedule at project kickoff so you always know what is happening on your plot and when.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📋</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Permits and Approvals</h3>
            <p>Residential construction in Lucknow requires a building permit from the Lucknow Development Authority (LDA) or Lucknow Municipal Corporation (LMC) depending on your plot location. VP Infra's team handles the complete approval process — map submission, NOC documentation, and compliance with UP Building Byelaws. Our clients do not need to run from office to office chasing stamps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🧱</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Materials and Quality</h3>
            <p>We use M25 grade concrete, Fe 500 grade TMT steel, and fly-ash or AAC block masonry for structural integrity. Flooring uses Kajaria or equivalent vitrified tiles. Electrical work uses FR-grade ISI marked wiring, and plumbing uses CPVC pipes for hot water and uPVC for drainage. Every material batch comes with a manufacturer's test certificate for your records.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📍</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Areas We Serve</h3>
            <p>VP Infra works across Ashiyana Colony, Gomti Nagar, Indira Nagar, Aliganj, Sushant Golf City, Kanpur Road, Faizabad Road, and Sitapur Road. Our office in Ashiyana Colony means your project always has a locally based team. If you need a <a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">building construction company in Lucknow</a> near your plot, our team can visit within 48 hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🛡️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Seismic Safety</h3>
            <p>All VP Infra residential structures are designed to IS 1893:2016 seismic zone specifications for Lucknow, which falls in Zone II/III. This means proper column-beam framework, reinforced foundations, and shear walls where required. The structural design is verified by qualified civil engineers before a single brick is placed on your site.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card know-card-highlight">
          <div class="know-icon">✅</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Our Promise to You</h3>
            <p>Building a home is a once-in-a-generation decision. VP Infra backs every project with ISO 9001:2015 certified processes, a structural warranty, milestone-based payments, and a dedicated site engineer you can reach on WhatsApp any time. We do not disappear after the keys are handed over.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does residential construction take in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A standard ground floor home in Lucknow takes 6 to 9 months from foundation casting to final handover, assuming building approvals are already in place. A double-storey home of similar footprint typically takes 10 to 14 months. VP Infra provides a detailed week-by-week construction schedule at project kickoff so you have full visibility throughout the build.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which is the best residential construction company in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>V.P. Infra Properties (OPC) Pvt. Ltd. is among the trusted residential construction companies in Lucknow, with ISO 9001:2015 certification and MSME registration under UDYAM UP-50-0085926. Their process includes site visit, structural design, LDA/LMC approval assistance, and fully supervised construction with regular client updates across Ashiyana Colony, Gomti Nagar, Indira Nagar, and Sushant Golf City.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does VP Infra help with LDA building permission in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. LDA building permission is a standard part of VP Infra's residential construction service. Their team prepares architectural drawings to LDA specifications, submits the building permission application, handles any clarifications raised by the authority, and receives the approved map on the client's behalf.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How do I choose a reliable home construction contractor in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>To choose a reliable home construction contractor in Lucknow, verify: MSME or GST registration, ISO certification, a physical office address, completed project references, a written contract with payment milestones, and a detailed Bill of Quantities before work begins. Avoid contractors who ask for large advance payments without a signed agreement.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does VP Infra offer earthquake-resistant home construction?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. All VP Infra residential structures are designed to IS 1893:2016 seismic zone specifications for Lucknow, which falls in Zone II/III. Proper column-beam framework, reinforced foundations, and shear walls are included where required. The structural design is verified by qualified civil engineers before construction begins.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can VP Infra build a house in Ashiyana Colony, Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. VP Infra's registered office is at M-652, Sector-M, Ashiyana Colony, Kanpur Road, Lucknow. They have completed residential projects across Ashiyana sectors and surrounding areas. They also offer dedicated <a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">custom home building services in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a> for clients wanting a fully customised design on their own plot.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Build Your Home in Lucknow?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 mb-8">Talk to our construction team today. We will visit your plot, understand your budget, and give you an honest plan with no pressure and no hidden charges.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Free Site Visit</a>
        <a href="tel:8840069902" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Call: 8840069902</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Also explore our <a href="/services/turnkey-building-contractors-in-lucknow/">turnkey building contractor services in Lucknow</a> for a complete, hassle-free construction experience.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Header */
  .page-header { background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: var(--text-light); padding: 8rem 0 6rem; }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 3.5rem; }

  /* Service Grid */
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; align-items: start; padding: 4rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; } }
  .service-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .benefits-list { list-style: none; }
  .benefits-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-gray); }
  .benefits-list li::before { content: '🏠'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
  .benefits-list strong { color: var(--secondary); }
  .related-links { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .related-links a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .internal-links-section { border-top: 1px solid #e0e7f0; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .internal-links-section p { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }

  /* ── Know Section ── */
  .know-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: #f4f7fb; }

  .know-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .know-subtitle { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  /* Stats bar */
  .know-stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .know-stat {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.4rem 1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }
  .know-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .know-stat-value { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; }
  .know-stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 0.2rem; text-align: center; }

  /* Cards grid */
  .know-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .know-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; } .know-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); flex: 1 1 45%; } }

  .know-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .know-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.11); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .know-card-highlight { border-left-color: var(--secondary); background: #fffaf4; }

  .know-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .know-card-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .know-card-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.72; margin: 0; }
  .know-card-body a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0e7f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .faq-item summary { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); list-style: none; }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.75; }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  .cta-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
  .cta-section .text-sm a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
</style>
